 r←Test_SelectionTool_002(stopFlag batchFlag);rc;parms;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "SelectionTool.Run" with just autoPress set and no global parms.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.autoPress←1
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.posn←100 100
 rc←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.SelectionTool.Run⍕¨1+⍳10
 →FailsIf 2≠⍴rc
 →FailsIf 0≠0⊃rc
 r←∆OK
